    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The new model our classic floating 24cm and 150g of weight.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you start looking for big fish it is right to use this stick. Big tuna or gt is the target, very frantic and precise swimming are the main characteristics.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Best hook setup: 5/0 treble in front and back or very big hooks front and rear.</p>",
